q q 108.75 0 0 46.47404 62.0938 720.3037 cm/Im1 Do Q q 68.25 0 0 32.25 488.4035 727.2 cm/Im2 Do Q q .266667 .266667 .266667 rg BT 9.6 TL/F2+0 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 23 Tm[-3944.0003]TJ( | Project documentation)Tj T* ET BT/F2+0 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 538.4492 23 Tm(Page 1)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 52 658 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 18 TL/F3+0 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 97.77441 3 Tm[-4223]TJ(: AI-Powered Travel Itinerary Planner)Tj T* ET Q q Q q q 1 0 0 1 58 626 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 12 TL/F3+0 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 2.3 Tm(Date)Tj T* ET Q q Q q 1 0 0 1 210.4 626 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 12 TL/F2+0 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 2.3 Tm(23 October 2026)Tj T* ET Q q Q q 1 0 0 1 58 604 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 12 TL/F3+0 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 2.3 Tm(Team ID)Tj T* ET Q q Q q 1 0 0 1 210.4 604 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 12 TL/F2+0 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 2.3 Tm T* ET Q q Q q 1 0 0 1 58 582 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 12 TL/F3+0 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 2.3 Tm(Project Name)Tj T* ET Q q Q q 1 0 0 1 210.4 582 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 12 TL/F2+0 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 2.3 Tm[-3944.0003]TJ( - AI Travel Itinerary Planner)Tj T* ET Q q Q q 1 0 0 1 52 577 cm 1 J 1 j .65 w n 0 66 m 508 66 l 0 0 0 RG S n 0 0 m 508 0 l S n 0 0 m 0 66 l S n 508 0 m 508 66 l S n 0 44 m 508 44 l S n 0 22 m 508 22 l S n 152.4 0 m 152.4 66 l S Q Q q Q q Q q 1 0 0 1 52 543 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 15 TL/F3+0 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 3 Tm(Project Description)Tj T* ET Q q Q q 1 0 0 1 52 498.4 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 13.2 TL/F2+0 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 29.1 Tm[-3944.0003]TJ( is a personalized travel itinerary planner for solo travelers, couples and small groups. It combines ready-made)Tj T*(trips with an AI-assisted builder that creates a dated, day-by-day schedule from destination, budget, style and)Tj T*(preferences.)Tj T* ET Q q Q q 1 0 0 1 52 452.8 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 13.2 TL/F2+0 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 29.1 Tm(The React interface presents saved trips and daily activities. The FastAPI backend handles authentication, input)Tj T*(validation, planning and persistence through Supabase or SQLite. Optional AI providers enhance generation; a local)Tj T*(rule-based engine supports operation without API keys.)Tj T* ET Q q Q q 1 0 0 1 52 428.8 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 15 TL/F3+0 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 3 Tm(Scenarios)Tj T* ET Q q Q q 1 0 0 1 52 410.6 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 13.2 TL/F2+0 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 2.7 Tm(- Scenario 1: A solo traveler opens the Goa template, reviews its daily plan and saves a dated copy to My trips.)Tj T* ET Q q Q q 1 0 0 1 52 378.2 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 13.2 TL/F2+0 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 15.9 Tm(- Scenario 2: A couple enters a destination, dates, budget, romance/culture style and pace. )Tj[-3944.0003]TJ( generates a plan)Tj T*(they can review and edit.)Tj T* ET Q q Q q 1 0 0 1 52 345.8 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 13.2 TL/F2+0 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 15.9 Tm(- Scenario 3: A traveler planning with companions shares a public itinerary link and downloads an ICS file for calendar)Tj T*(use.)Tj T* ET Q q Q q 1 0 0 1 52 328.6 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 11.2 TL/F2+0 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 2.2 Tm(These scenarios illustrate intended flows; they do not represent recorded user research or a newly executed live demo.)Tj T* ET Q q Q Q
endstream
